  "texts": {
    "briefing": "WOW! That was hard! And look at the time!\n\nOh no! It's 3 minutes before closing time!\n\nAnd you haven't shopped yet!\n\nYou need the following stuff:\n\n* 4 Apples\n* 1 Pack of toilet paper\n* 2 Bottles of cola\n* 3 Onions\n* 1 Bag of M&M's\n* 1 Pack of cigarettes\n* 1 Sausage\n* 1 Crate of beer\n* 2 Packs cookies\n* 1 Pack of washing powder\n* 2 Choclate bars\n* 1 Bottle of wine\n\nBut be careful because you don't have\nmuch money. Look for the bargains!",
    "success": "Congratulations!\n\nYou finished the final level of Tank Arena!\n\nYou're now an official Tank Arena guru!"
  },
